{"seq":1,"slug":"java-util-concurrent","title":"java.util.concurrent 核心组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/concurrency-in-depth/java-util-concurrent","wordCount":820,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"java-util-concurrent-核心组件\">java.util.concurrent 核心组件</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>java.util.concurrent</code>（j.u.c）是 Java 5 引入的并发工具包，由 Doug Lea 主导设计，提供了线程池、原子变量、并发集合、同步器等高级并发构建块。相比于原始的 synchronized 和 wait/notify，j.u.c 提供了更灵活、更高性能的并发解决方案。理解其核心组件的设计和使用方式，是 Java 并发编程的必备技能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[j.u.c 核心组件] --&gt; B[Executor 框架]&#10;    A --&gt; C[原子变量]&#10;    A --&gt; D[并发集合]&#10;    A --&gt; E[同步工具]&#10;    B --&gt; F[ThreadPoolExecutor]&#10;    B --&gt; G[ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor]&#10;    C --&gt; H[AtomicInteger/Long]&#10;    C --&gt; I[AtomicReference]&#10;    C --&gt; J[LongAdder]&#10;    D --&gt; K[ConcurrentHashMap]&#10;    D --&gt; L[BlockingQueue]&#10;    E --&gt; M[CountDownLatch]&#10;    E --&gt; N[Semaphore]&#10;    E --&gt; O[CyclicBarrier]\">graph TD\n    A[j.u.c 核心组件] --&gt; B[Executor 框架]\n    A --&gt; C[原子变量]\n    A --&gt; D[并发集合]\n    A --&gt; E[同步工具]\n    B --&gt; F[ThreadPoolExecutor]\n    B --&gt; G[ScheduledThreadPoolExecutor]\n    C --&gt; H[AtomicInteger/Long]\n    C --&gt; I[AtomicReference]\n    C --&gt; J[LongAdder]\n    D --&gt; K[ConcurrentHashMap]\n    D --&gt; L[BlockingQueue]\n    E --&gt; M[CountDownLatch]\n    E --&gt; N[Semaphore]\n    E --&gt; O[CyclicBarrier]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件类别</th>\n<th>核心类</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Executor 框架</td>\n<td>ThreadPoolExecutor</td>\n<td>线程生命周期管理，任务调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原子变量</td>\n<td>AtomicInteger, LongAdder</td>\n<td>无锁线程安全计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发集合</td>\n<td>ConcurrentHashMap, BlockingQueue</td>\n<td>线程安全的数据结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步工具</td>\n<td>CountDownLatch, Semaphore</td>\n<td>线程间协调与通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Future</td>\n<td>CompletableFuture</td>\n<td>异步计算结果获取</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"threadpoolexecutor-深入解析\">ThreadPoolExecutor 深入解析</h2><p>ThreadPoolExecutor 是 Java 线程池的核心实现。理解其 7 个构造参数和任务处理流程是正确使用线程池的关键。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"ThreadPoolExecutor executor = new ThreadPoolExecutor(&#10;    4,                             // corePoolSize: 核心线程数&#10;    8,                             // maximumPoolSize: 最大线程数&#10;    60L,                           // keepAliveTime: 非核心线程空闲存活时间&#10;    TimeUnit.SECONDS,              // unit: 时间单位&#10;    new ArrayBlockingQueue&lt;&gt;(100), // workQueue: 任务队列&#10;    new ThreadFactory() {          // threadFactory: 线程创建工厂&#10;        private final AtomicInteger counter = new AtomicInteger(1);&#10;        public Thread newThread(Runnable r) {&#10;            Thread t = new Thread(r, &quot;biz-pool-&quot; + counter.getAndIncrement());&#10;            t.setDaemon(false);&#10;            return t;&#10;        }&#10;    },&#10;    new ThreadPoolExecutor.CallerRunsPolicy()  // handler: 拒绝策略&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ThreadPoolExecutor executor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ThreadPoolExecutor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// corePoolSize: 核心线程数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// maximumPoolSize: 最大线程数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    60L</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// keepAliveTime: 非核心线程空闲存活时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    TimeUnit.SECONDS,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// unit: 时间单位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ArrayBlockingQueue&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// workQueue: 任务队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ThreadFactory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// threadFactory: 线程创建工厂</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AtomicInteger counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicInteger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Thread </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">newThread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Runnable </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Thread t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Thread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"biz-pool-\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getAndIncrement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            t.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setDaemon</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ThreadPoolExecutor.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CallerRunsPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// handler: 拒绝策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>任务提交流程</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[提交任务] --&gt; B{核心线程满?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[创建核心线程执行]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{队列满?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[任务入队列]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{达到最大线程数?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[创建非核心线程执行]&#10;    F --&gt;|是| H[执行拒绝策略]\">graph TD\n    A[提交任务] --&gt; B{核心线程满?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[创建核心线程执行]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{队列满?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[任务入队列]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{达到最大线程数?}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[创建非核心线程执行]\n    F --&gt;|是| H[执行拒绝策略]</pre><p><strong>四种内置拒绝策略</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AbortPolicy（默认）</td>\n<td>抛出 RejectedExecutionException</td>\n<td>需要感知拒绝的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CallerRunsPolicy</td>\n<td>提交线程自己执行</td>\n<td>需要反压的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DiscardPolicy</td>\n<td>静默丢弃</td>\n<td>可容忍丢失的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DiscardOldestPolicy</td>\n<td>丢弃队列头部任务</td>\n<td>优先处理新任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>线程池大小经验公式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// CPU 密集型：N_threads = N_cpu + 1&#10;// IO 密集型：N_threads = N_cpu × (1 + W/C)&#10;//   W = 等待时间，C = 计算时间&#10;&#10;// 不要使用 Executors 工厂方法：&#10;// Executors.newFixedThreadPool → 无界队列，可能 OOM&#10;// Executors.newCachedThreadPool → 无限创建线程，可能 OOM&#10;// 始终使用 ThreadPoolExecutor 构造器，明确每个参数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CPU 密集型：N_threads = N_cpu + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// IO 密集型：N_threads = N_cpu × (1 + W/C)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   W = 等待时间，C = 计算时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不要使用 Executors 工厂方法：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Executors.newFixedThreadPool → 无界队列，可能 OOM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Executors.newCachedThreadPool → 无限创建线程，可能 OOM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 始终使用 ThreadPoolExecutor 构造器，明确每个参数</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"原子变量与-cas\">原子变量与 CAS</h2><p>j.u.c.atomic 包提供了基于 CAS（Compare-And-Swap）的原子操作类，在无锁的情况下实现线程安全的读写。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"AtomicInteger counter = new AtomicInteger(0);&#10;&#10;counter.incrementAndGet();     // 原子自增&#10;counter.compareAndSet(5, 10);  // CAS：期望值为5时设为10&#10;counter.getAndUpdate(x -&gt; x * 2);  // 原子更新&#10;&#10;// CAS 的底层实现&#10;// Unsafe.compareAndSwapInt(obj, offset, expect, update)&#10;// 映射到 CPU 的 CMPXCHG 指令（x86）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">AtomicInteger counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicInteger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">incrementAndGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原子自增</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compareAndSet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CAS：期望值为5时设为10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getAndUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原子更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CAS 的底层实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Unsafe.compareAndSwapInt(obj, offset, expect, update)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 映射到 CPU 的 CMPXCHG 指令（x86）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>ABA 问题与解决</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// ABA 问题：值从 A → B → A，CAS 认为没有变化&#10;AtomicStampedReference&lt;String&gt; ref = new AtomicStampedReference&lt;&gt;(&quot;A&quot;, 0);&#10;int[] stampHolder = new int[1];&#10;String current = ref.ge